# Author: Oleksii Hnidan
# Project: web-security26 | Lab: 3 | File: basic-authorization.http
# Each Lab 2 route is called once with valid and once with invalid credentials.
# With Spring Boot 4, POST, PUT, and DELETE return 401 without a CSRF token,
# even with valid Basic credentials. CSRF handling belongs to the next lab.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tracks

### 1. GET all tracks with valid credentials — expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET all tracks with invalid credentials — expected 401
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Basic admin wrong-password
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET track 1 with valid credentials — expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET track 1 with invalid credentials — expected 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Basic admin wrong-password
Accept: application/json

### 5. POST a track with valid credentials — expected 401 (CSRF token required)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Be Quiet and Drive (Far Away)",
  "artist": "Deftones",
  "album": "Around the Fur",
  "durationSeconds": 300
}

### 6. POST a track with invalid credentials — expected 401
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Basic admin wrong-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Be Quiet and Drive (Far Away)",
  "artist": "Deftones",
  "album": "Around the Fur",
  "durationSeconds": 300
}

### 7. PUT track 4 with valid credentials — expected 401 (CSRF token required)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Be Quiet and Drive (Far Away)",
  "artist": "Deftones",
  "album": "Around the Fur",
  "durationSeconds": 301
}

### 8. PUT track 4 with invalid credentials — expected 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/4
Authorization: Basic admin wrong-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Be Quiet and Drive (Far Away)",
  "artist": "Deftones",
  "album": "Around the Fur",
  "durationSeconds": 301
}

### 9. DELETE track 4 with valid credentials — expected 401 (CSRF token required)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 10. DELETE track 4 with invalid credentials — expected 401
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4
Authorization: Basic admin wrong-password
Accept: application/json
